se?
2. What evidence would instead support that first useful activity varies by b=
ranch?
3. How do we rule out that some customer types need assisted follow-up?

This has returned because the previous answer was useful but not strong enoug=
h to become a standing rule. Use February 2025 as the new evidence point rath=
er than recycling the earlier conclusion. Please work towards where branch co=
aching or onboarding process changes are needed. A useful output would be a c=
ontrol view with the exceptions, owner and reason each item was included.

